[
    {
        "content": "<p>Is there any way to programmatically recover the homogeneous version <code>Add.add</code> (and other operators like this) from a heterogeneous version like `HAdd.hAdd Nat Nat (instHAdd Nat instAddNat ..)?</p>",
        "id": 621225670,
        "sender_full_name": "Leni Aniva",
        "timestamp": 1788405065
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>What do you mean by \"recover\"? Do you mean extract the instance of <code>Add Nat</code> from the term <code>@HAdd.hAdd Nat Nat Nat (@instHAdd Nat instAddNat)</code>? Do you mean recover the name <code>Add.add</code> from <code>HAdd.hAdd</code>? Do you mean something else?</p>",
        "id": 621226982,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1788405550
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"816344\">Aaron Liu</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/239415-metaprogramming-.2F-tactics/topic/Recover.20.60Add.60.20from.20.60HAdd.60/near/621226982\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What do you mean by \"recover\"? Do you mean extract the instance of <code>Add Nat</code> from the term <code>@HAdd.hAdd Nat Nat Nat (@instHAdd Nat instAddNat)</code>? Do you mean recover the name <code>Add.add</code> from <code>HAdd.hAdd</code>? Do you mean something else?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>convert the heterogeneous version to the homogeneous verison</p>",
        "id": 621227019,
        "sender_full_name": "Leni Aniva",
        "timestamp": 1788405564
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Looks like this case is just unfolding the class projection:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">run_meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``Nat</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">addInst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``instAddNat</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">haddInst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">mkApp2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``instHAdd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">])</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">addInst</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">mkAppN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``HAdd.hAdd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">])</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">haddInst</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mkNatLit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mkNatLit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"before: {e}\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">withTransparency</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unfoldDefinition</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">throwError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"could not unfold\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"after:  {e'}\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 621331319,
        "sender_full_name": "Yiming Fu",
        "timestamp": 1788430623
    }
